          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(181)\n\n# 1) Verifikasi Identitas Eksak Krogh-Vedelsby (1995): MSE_ens == Mean_MSE - Ambiguity\nn = 1000\ny_true = rng.normal(5.0, 2.0, size=n)\n\n# Simulasikan 3 model beragam (Linear, MLP, GBDT) dengan residual tak identik\ne_lin = rng.normal(0.0, 1.15, size=n)\ne_mlp = 0.50 * e_lin + rng.normal(0.0, 0.90, size=n)\ne_gbd = 0.45 * e_lin + 0.35 * e_mlp + rng.normal(0.0, 0.72, size=n)\npreds = np.vstack([y_true + e_lin, y_true + e_mlp, y_true + e_gbd])  # bentuk (M, n)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Verifikasi Numerik Identitas Krogh-Vedelsby (MSE_ens = E_bar - A_bar) ===\")\nfor name, w in [\n    (\"Bobot Seragam (1/3, 1/3, 1/3)\", np.array([1.0 / 3, 1.0 / 3, 1.0 / 3])),\n    (\"Bobot Terbobot (0.20, 0.30, 0.50)\", np.array([0.20, 0.30, 0.50])),\n]:\n    f_ens = w @ preds\n    mse_ens = float(np.mean((f_ens - y_true) ** 2))\n    indiv_mse = np.mean((preds - y_true[None, :]) ** 2, axis=1)\n    e_bar = float(w @ indiv_mse)\n    amb_bar = float(np.mean(w @ ((preds - f_ens[None, :]) ** 2)))\n    gap = abs(mse_ens - (e_bar - amb_bar))\n    print(f\"{name:34s} | E_bar={e_bar:.5f} | A_bar={amb_bar:.5f} | MSE_ens={mse_ens:.5f} | |Gap|={gap:.1e}\")\n\n# 2) Bukti Kuantitatif Lantai Korelasi Residual: 5 GBDT Identik (rho=0.98) vs 3 Keluarga (rho=0.65)\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Pengaruh Korelasi Residual Rata-Rata (rho) pada Reduksi MSE Ensemble ===\")\nprint(\"Skenario Ensemble                    | M | rho  | MSE_ind | MSE_ens Teori | Turun MSE | Biaya CPU\")\nprint(\"-\" * 98)\nsigma2 = 1.0\nfor label, M, rho in [\n    (\"1 Model GBDT Tunggal\", 1, 1.00),\n    (\"5 GBDT Identik (beda seed tipis)\", 5, 0.98),\n    (\"5 GBDT Beda Hyperparam Moderat\", 5, 0.90),\n    (\"3 Keluarga (Linear + MLP + GBDT)\", 3, 0.65),\n    (\"3 Keluarga Sangat Komplementer\", 3, 0.45),\n]:\n    mse_theo = sigma2 * (1.0 + (M - 1) * rho) / M\n    drop_pct = 100.0 * (1.0 - mse_theo / sigma2)\n    print(f\"{label:36s} | {M:1d} | {rho:4.2f} | {sigma2:7.4f} | {mse_theo:13.4f} | {drop_pct:8.2f}% | {M}x\")\n\n# 3) Implementasi Dari Nol Metrik Diversitas Klasifikasi Kuncheva & Whitaker (2003)\ndef kuncheva_pairwise_metrics(c1: np.ndarray, c2: np.ndarray) -> tuple[float, float, float, float]:\n    \"\"\"c1, c2: array biner 1=prediksi benar, 0=prediksi salah.\"\"\"\n    n11 = float(np.sum((c1 == 1) & (c2 == 1)))\n    n10 = float(np.sum((c1 == 1) & (c2 == 0)))\n    n01 = float(np.sum((c1 == 0) & (c2 == 1)))\n    n00 = float(np.sum((c1 == 0) & (c2 == 0)))\n    tot = n11 + n10 + n01 + n00\n    num_q = n11 * n00 - n01 * n10\n    den_q = n11 * n00 + n01 * n10\n    yule_q = num_q / den_q if den_q > 0 else 0.0\n    disagreement = (n10 + n01) / tot\n    double_fault = n00 / tot\n    den_r = np.sqrt((n11 + n10) * (n01 + n00) * (n11 + n01) * (n10 + n00))\n    corr_r = num_q / den_r if den_r > 0 else 0.0\n    return yule_q, disagreement, double_fault, corr_r\n\n# Tiga pasangan dengan akurasi individu identik (82%), tetapi pola kesalahan berbeda drastis\nbase_ok = (rng.uniform(0, 1, size=1000) < 0.82).astype(int)\ntwin_ok = base_ok.copy()\nflip_small = rng.choice(1000, size=18, replace=False)\ntwin_ok[flip_small] = 1 - twin_ok[flip_small]\n\nindep_ok = (rng.uniform(0, 1, size=1000) < 0.82).astype(int)\n\ncomp_ok = np.ones(1000, dtype=int)\nwrong_base = np.where(base_ok == 0)[0]\nright_base = np.where(base_ok == 1)[0]\n# Pasangan komplementer: hanya sedikit gagal bersamaan, sebagian besar salah di titik berbeda\ncomp_wrong = np.concatenate([\n    rng.choice(wrong_base, size=min(15, len(wrong_base)), replace=False),\n    rng.choice(right_base, size=max(0, 180 - min(15, len(wrong_base))), replace=False),\n])\ncomp_ok[comp_wrong] = 0\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 3. Metrik Diversitas Kuncheva (2003) pada Akurasi Individu ~82% ===\")\nprint(\"Pasangan Klasifier               | Yule Q  | Disagreement D | Double-Fault DF | Korelasi rho\")\nprint(\"-\" * 92)\nfor label, other in [\n    (\"Kembar (2 GBDT nyaris identik)\", twin_ok),\n    (\"Independen (kesalahan acak)\", indep_ok),\n    (\"Komplementer (kesalahan saling tukar)\", comp_ok),\n]:\n    q, d, df, r = kuncheva_pairwise_metrics(base_ok, other)\n    print(f\"{label:37s} | {q:+7.4f} | {d:14.4f} | {df:15.4f} | {r:+12.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Verifikasi Numerik Identitas Krogh-Vedelsby (MSE_ens = E_bar - A_bar) ===\nBobot Seragam (1/3, 1/3, 1/3)      | E_bar=1.19560 | A_bar=0.33821 | MSE_ens=0.85739 | |Gap|=0.0e+00\nBobot Terbobot (0.20, 0.30, 0.50)  | E_bar=1.16283 | A_bar=0.30150 | MSE_ens=0.86134 | |Gap|=0.0e+00\n\n=== 2. Pengaruh Korelasi Residual Rata-Rata (rho) pada Reduksi MSE Ensemble ===\nSkenario Ensemble                    | M | rho  | MSE_ind | MSE_ens Teori | Turun MSE | Biaya CPU\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1 Model GBDT Tunggal                 | 1 | 1.00 |  1.0000 |        1.0000 |     0.00% | 1x\n5 GBDT Identik (beda seed tipis)     | 5 | 0.98 |  1.0000 |        0.9840 |     1.60% | 5x\n5 GBDT Beda Hyperparam Moderat       | 5 | 0.90 |  1.0000 |        0.9200 |     8.00% | 5x\n3 Keluarga (Linear + MLP + GBDT)     | 3 | 0.65 |  1.0000 |        0.7667 |    23.33% | 3x\n3 Keluarga Sangat Komplementer       | 3 | 0.45 |  1.0000 |        0.6333 |    36.67% | 3x\n\n=== 3. Metrik Diversitas Kuncheva (2003) pada Akurasi Individu ~82% ===\nPasangan Klasifier               | Yule Q  | Disagreement D | Double-Fault DF | Korelasi rho\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nKembar (2 GBDT nyaris identik)        | +1.0000 |         0.0180 |          0.1860 |      +0.9442\nIndependen (kesalahan acak)           | +0.0899 |         0.2830 |          0.0350 |      +0.0271\nKomplementer (kesalahan saling tukar) | -0.4870 |         0.3360 |          0.0150 |      -0.1236",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Verifikasi Numerik Identitas Krogh-Vedelsby (MSE_ens = E_bar - A_bar) ===\nBobot Seragam (1/3, 1/3, 1/3)      | E_bar=1.19560 | A_bar=0.33821 | MSE_ens=0.85739 | |Gap|=0.0e+00\nBobot Terbobot (0.20, 0.30, 0.50)  | E_bar=1.16283 | A_bar=0.30150 | MSE_ens=0.86134 | |Gap|=0.0e+00\n\n=== 2. Pengaruh Korelasi Residual Rata-Rata (rho) pada Reduksi MSE Ensemble ===\nSkenario Ensemble                    | M | rho  | MSE_ind | MSE_ens Teori | Turun MSE | Biaya CPU\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1 Model GBDT Tunggal                 | 1 | 1.00 |  1.0000 |        1.0000 |     0.00% | 1x\n5 GBDT Identik (beda seed tipis)     | 5 | 0.98 |  1.0000 |        0.9840 |     1.60% | 5x\n5 GBDT Beda Hyperparam Moderat       | 5 | 0.90 |  1.0000 |        0.9200 |     8.00% | 5x\n3 Keluarga (Linear + MLP + GBDT)     | 3 | 0.65 |  1.0000 |        0.7667 |    23.33% | 3x\n3 Keluarga Sangat Komplementer       | 3 | 0.45 |  1.0000 |        0.6333 |    36.67% | 3x\n\n=== 3. Metrik Diversitas Kuncheva (2003) pada Akurasi Individu ~82% ===\nPasangan Klasifier               | Yule Q  | Disagreement D | Double-Fault DF | Korelasi rho\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nKembar (2 GBDT nyaris identik)        | +1.0000 |         0.0180 |          0.1860 |      +0.9442\nIndependen (kesalahan acak)           | +0.0899 |         0.2830 |          0.0350 |      +0.0271\nKomplementer (kesalahan saling tukar) | -0.4870 |         0.3360 |          0.0150 |      -0.1236",
