          "id": "code-ml-18-1-ch18_1_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: Homogeneous (5x HistGBDT) vs Heterogeneous (Spline+Ridge, MLP, HistGBDT)",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "18_1_sklearn_homo_vs_hetero_diversity.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import GradientBoostingRegressor, HistGradientBoostingRegressor\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nfrom sklearn.metrics import root_mean_squared_error\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.neural_network import MLPRegressor\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import SplineTransformer, StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(182)\nN = 750\nX = rng.uniform(-2.5, 2.5, size=(N, 6))\n\n# Fungsi target dunia nyata: gabungan tren halus global (disukai Spline/MLP) + interaksi tangga (disukai GBDT)\ny = (\n    2.4 * X[:, 0]\n    - 1.6 * np.sin(1.4 * X[:, 1])\n    + 0.75 * (X[:, 2] ** 2)\n    + 2.2 * ((X[:, 3] > 0.3) & (X[:, 4] < 0.4)).astype(float)\n    - 1.5 * (X[:, 5] > 1.0).astype(float)\n    + 0.9 * X[:, 0] * X[:, 2]\n    + rng.normal(0.0, 0.85, size=N)\n)\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.30, random_state=42)\n\n# A) Homogeneous Ensemble: 5 GBDT serupa (beda random_state & subsample tipis -> korelasi residual > 0.97!)\nhomo_models = [\n    GradientBoostingRegressor(\n        n_estimators=40, max_depth=3, learning_rate=0.09, subsample=0.92, random_state=10 + k\n    ).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n    for k in range(5)\n]\n\n# B) Heterogeneous Ensemble: 3 keluarga induktif berbeda (Spline+Ridge, MLP, HistGBDT)\nm_spline = Pipeline([\n    (\"sp\", SplineTransformer(n_knots=5, degree=3)),\n    (\"rg\", Ridge(alpha=2.0)),\n]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\nm_mlp = Pipeline([\n    (\"sc\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"mlp\", MLPRegressor(hidden_layer_sizes=(24, 12), solver=\"lbfgs\", alpha=0.15, max_iter=140, random_state=42)),\n]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\nm_hgb = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(\n    max_iter=35, max_depth=4, max_bins=64, learning_rate=0.09, early_stopping=False, random_state=42\n).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\nhetero_models = [(\"Spline+Ridge\", m_spline), (\"MLP (24,12)\", m_mlp), (\"HistGBDT\", m_hgb)]\n\ndef audit_reg_ensemble(name: str, pred_mat: np.ndarray, y_eval: np.ndarray) -> None:\n    M = pred_mat.shape[0]\n    w = np.full(M, 1.0 / M)\n    f_ens = w @ pred_mat\n    errs = pred_mat - y_eval[None, :]\n    corr = np.corrcoef(errs)\n    mean_rho = float((np.sum(corr) - M) / (M * (M - 1)))\n    e_bar = float(np.mean(errs ** 2))\n    a_bar = float(np.mean((pred_mat - f_ens[None, :]) ** 2))\n    mse_ens = float(np.mean((f_ens - y_eval) ** 2))\n    rmse_ens = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_eval, f_ens))\n    print(f\"{name:34s} | rho={mean_rho:.4f} | E_bar={e_bar:.4f} | A_bar={a_bar:.4f} | MSE={mse_ens:.4f} | RMSE={rmse_ens:.4f}\")\n\nprint(f\"=== Performa Model Tunggal pada Data Uji (N_test={len(y_te)}) ===\")\nfor m_name, mdl in hetero_models:\n    print(f\"  Single {m_name:14s} | Test RMSE = {root_mean_squared_error(y_te, mdl.predict(X_te)):.4f}\")\n\nhomo_preds = np.vstack([m.predict(X_te) for m in homo_models])\nhetero_preds = np.vstack([m.predict(X_te) for _, m in hetero_models])\n\nprint(\"\\n=== Perbandingan Homogeneous (5x GBDT) vs Heterogeneous (3 Keluarga) ===\")\naudit_reg_ensemble(\"Homogeneous (5x GBDT)\", homo_preds, y_te)\naudit_reg_ensemble(\"Heterogeneous (Spline+MLP+GBDT)\", hetero_preds, y_te)",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Performa Model Tunggal pada Data Uji (N_test=225) ===\n  Single Spline+Ridge   | Test RMSE = 2.3930\n  Single MLP (24,12)    | Test RMSE = 1.3620\n  Single HistGBDT       | Test RMSE = 1.5041\n\n=== Perbandingan Homogeneous (5x GBDT) vs Heterogeneous (3 Keluarga) ===\nHomogeneous (5x GBDT)              | rho=0.9840 | E_bar=2.3266 | A_bar=0.0299 | MSE=2.2968 | RMSE=1.5155\nHeterogeneous (Spline+MLP+GBDT)    | rho=0.5358 | E_bar=3.2814 | A_bar=1.1498 | MSE=2.1316 | RMSE=1.4600",
          "actualOutput": "=== Performa Model Tunggal pada Data Uji (N_test=225) ===\n  Single Spline+Ridge   | Test RMSE = 2.3930\n  Single MLP (24,12)    | Test RMSE = 1.3620\n  Single HistGBDT       | Test RMSE = 1.5041\n\n=== Perbandingan Homogeneous (5x GBDT) vs Heterogeneous (3 Keluarga) ===\nHomogeneous (5x GBDT)              | rho=0.9840 | E_bar=2.3266 | A_bar=0.0299 | MSE=2.2968 | RMSE=1.5155\nHeterogeneous (Spline+MLP+GBDT)    | rho=0.5358 | E_bar=3.2814 | A_bar=1.1498 | MSE=2.1316 | RMSE=1.4600",
          "explanation": "Mengukur korelasi residual pasangan, rata-rata MSE, suku ambiguitas, dan RMSE uji pada dataset gabungan tren halus + interaksi tangga antara 5 HistGBDT serupa melawan 3 keluarga induktif berbeda.",
