          "actualOutput": "=== Performa Base Learners Tunggal (Train vs Test RMSE) ===\n  Ridge        | In-Sample RMSE=1.9429 | OOF RMSE=1.9863 | Test RMSE=1.9343\n  GBDT         | In-Sample RMSE=1.5175 | OOF RMSE=2.0291 | Test RMSE=2.1125\n  OverfitTree  | In-Sample RMSE=0.0000 | OOF RMSE=2.6937 | Test RMSE=2.8725\n\n=== Bencana In-Sample Stacking vs Strict Out-of-Fold (OOF) Stacking ===\nIn-Sample (BOCOR) | Bobot [Ridge, GBDT, OverfitTree] = [-0.0000, +0.0002, +0.9999] | Test RMSE=2.8724\nStrict 5-Fold OOF | Bobot [Ridge, GBDT, OverfitTree] = [+0.5743, +0.3896, +0.0963] | Test RMSE=1.9462",
