          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nfrom scipy.stats import rankdata\nfrom sklearn.metrics import log_loss, roc_auc_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2026)\n\n# AUDIT 1: Varians Tinggi Holdout Blending (15% holdout) vs Stabilitas OOF Caruana pada 10 Seed\nn_dev, n_lock = 900, 700\nz_dev = rng.normal(-3.45, 1.35, size=n_dev)\ny_dev = (rng.uniform(0, 1, size=n_dev) < 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-z_dev))).astype(int)\nz_lock = rng.normal(-3.45, 1.35, size=n_lock)\ny_lock = (rng.uniform(0, 1, size=n_lock) < 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-z_lock))).astype(int)\n\nsigmas = [0.65, 0.72, 0.85, 1.10, 1.30]\nP_dev = np.vstack([1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(z_dev + rng.normal(0.0, s, size=n_dev)))) for s in sigmas])\nP_lock = np.vstack([1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(z_lock + rng.normal(0.0, s, size=n_lock)))) for s in sigmas])\nM = len(sigmas)\n\nblend_w0, blend_ll = [], []\nfor seed in range(10):\n    r_s = np.random.default_rng(100 + seed)\n    hold_idx = r_s.choice(n_dev, size=int(0.15 * n_dev), replace=False)\n    res = minimize(\n        lambda w: log_loss(y_dev[hold_idx], np.clip(w @ P_dev[:, hold_idx], 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6)),\n        x0=np.full(M, 1.0 / M),\n        bounds=[(0.0, 1.0)] * M,\n        constraints={\"type\": \"eq\", \"fun\": lambda w: np.sum(w) - 1.0},\n    )\n    blend_w0.append(float(res.x[0]))\n    blend_ll.append(float(log_loss(y_lock, np.clip(res.x @ P_lock, 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6))))\n\n# Caruana OOF memakai 100% n_dev\ncounts = np.zeros(M, dtype=int)\nrsum = np.zeros(n_dev)\nfor t in range(1, 26):\n    best_m = int(np.argmin([log_loss(y_dev, np.clip((rsum + P_dev[m]) / t, 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6)) for m in range(M)]))\n    rsum += P_dev[best_m]\n    counts[best_m] += 1\nw_car = counts / 25.0\np_car_lock = w_car @ P_lock\np_rank_lock = np.mean(np.vstack([rankdata(P_lock[m]) / n_lock for m in range(M)]), axis=0)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit Stabilitas: Holdout Blending (10 Seed Acak 15%) vs OOF Caruana ===\")\nprint(f\"Holdout Blending w[Model0]: min={min(blend_w0):.3f}, max={max(blend_w0):.3f}, std={np.std(blend_w0):.3f} | Lock LogLoss={np.mean(blend_ll):.4f} +/- {np.std(blend_ll):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"OOF Caruana (100% Data)   : w[Model0]={w_car[0]:.3f} (deterministik)          | Lock LogLoss={log_loss(y_lock, np.clip(p_car_lock, 1e-6, 1-1e-6)):.4f}\")\n\n# AUDIT 2: Simulasi Bencana Bisnis Expected-Value Bidding Saat Output Rank Averaging Dipakai Sebagai Probabilitas\n# Nilai konversi V = $25, biaya tayang iklan C = $2.00 -> ambil bid HANYA jika E[Profit] = p_hat * 25 - 2.0 > 0 (p_hat > 0.08)\nV_conv, C_bid = 25.0, 2.0\nprint(f\"\\n=== 2. Simulasi Profit Expected-Value Bidding (N={n_lock}, BaseRate={y_lock.mean():.2%}, Ambang EV p>0.08) ===\")\nprint(\"Sumber Skor Probabilitas  | AUROC  | Bid Diambil | Win Konversi | Profit Bersih ($)\")\nprint(\"-\" * 82)\nfor label, score in [\n    (\"OOF Caruana (Terkalibrasi)\", p_car_lock),\n    (\"Rank Averaging (BAHAYA!)\", p_rank_lock),\n]:\n    take = (score * V_conv) > C_bid\n    n_taken = int(np.sum(take))\n    n_wins = int(np.sum(y_lock[take]))\n    profit = float(n_wins * V_conv - n_taken * C_bid)\n    print(f\"{label:26s} | {roc_auc_score(y_lock, score):.4f} | {n_taken:11d} | {n_wins:12d} | {profit:+17.2f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Stabilitas: Holdout Blending (10 Seed Acak 15%) vs OOF Caruana ===\nHoldout Blending w[Model0]: min=0.000, max=0.644, std=0.217 | Lock LogLoss=0.1722 +/- 0.0032\nOOF Caruana (100% Data)   : w[Model0]=0.440 (deterministik)          | Lock LogLoss=0.1681\n\n=== 2. Simulasi Profit Expected-Value Bidding (N=700, BaseRate=4.57%, Ambang EV p>0.08) ===\nSumber Skor Probabilitas  | AUROC  | Bid Diambil | Win Konversi | Profit Bersih ($)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nOOF Caruana (Terkalibrasi) | 0.7803 |         183 |           22 |           +184.00\nRank Averaging (BAHAYA!)   | 0.7813 |         678 |           32 |           -556.00",
